# Conclusion — Let's Build Useful Things Together
:::

:::shape id=card_cheat at=top-left width=1120 height=260 offsetX=80 offsetY=150 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=icn_cheat at=top-left width=36 height=36 offsetX=104 offsetY=174 name=check-square size=32 color=#06B6D4
