:::text id=txt_cheat at=top-left width=1040 height=200 offsetX=104 offsetY=214 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=16
**Collaboration Cheatsheet:**
- **Context upfront**: Structure updates as Context -> Problem -> Solution.
- **Face-to-face**: Preferred channel for feedback on shared impact.
- **Support the bugs**: Echo back key points, tag urgency, and protect energy.
- **Respect focus time**: Pre-notify check-ins and explain rejections.
:::

:::shape id=card_quote at=top-left width=1120 height=160 offsetX=80 offsetY=430 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=icn_quote at=top-left width=36 height=36 offsetX=104 offsetY=454 name=quote size=32 color=#06B6D4
:::

:::text id=txt_quote at=top-left width=1020 height=100 offsetX=156 offsetY=450 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=18
"This manual is a living document—let's keep communicating, building, and improving together to **Build useful things**!"
:::
